*** Add File:ops/monitoring/alerts_tuning_guidance.md
+Tuning guidance for Prometheus alerts and Flagger metrics
+
+1) Baseline measurement
+ - Run representative traffic for at least 24 hours in staging; collect request rate, p95 latency, and error rates.
+ - Determine normal operating percentiles (p50,p95,p99) and 99.9th percentiles for errors.
+
+2) Set conservative SLOs for initial rollouts
+ - request-success-rate: 98-99% initial threshold (Flagger rule threshold set to 99 in canary manifest)
+ - p95 latency: set to 2x your measured normal p95 (reduce over time)
+ - DPBudget remaining: set low threshold to alert before budget critically low (example 1.0)
+
+3) Flagger step weights & maxWeight
+ - Start with small stepWeight (10) and maxWeight (30) for canary; increase as you gain confidence.
+ - Use webhooks for functional smoke tests in addition to metric checks.
+
+4) Iterate
+ - After each canary, review alerts triggered and adjust thresholds, step sizes, and interval durations.
+
